const APPS=[['dashboard','Overview','home'],['tasks','My Tasks','tasks'],['profile','Profile','user'],['time','Time & Attendance','time'],['regularize','Regularize Attendance','clock'],['members','Our Team','users'],['payslips','My Payslips','wallet'],['compensation','Compensation','wallet'],['recruitment','Recruitment','briefcase'],['performance','Performance','chart'],['documents','My Documents','document'],['employees','Employee Accounts','users'],['team','My Team','users'],['attendance-admin','Attendance Edit','calendar'],['attendance-requests','Regularize Requests','clock'],['document-centre','Document Centre','document'],['flows','Flows','flow'],['policies','Guidelines','shield'],['org','Org View','org'],['vibe','Vibe','chat'],['helpdesk','Helpdesk','help'],['talent','Talent Hub','star'],['expenses','Expenses','wallet'],['it','IT Support','help'],['admin-services','Colleague Services','building'],['travel','Travel desk','plane'],['benefits','Benefits','gift'],['refyne','Financial Wellbeing','money'],['learn','Learn & Grow','book']].map(([id,name,ico])=>({id,name,ico}));
const app=id=>APPS.find(x=>x.id===id)||{id,name:'Admin Review',ico:'shield'};
